# Test run output. These are artifacts of a single local run, not source:
# 72 junit XMLs plus an HTML report and a JSON summary were previously tracked
# (548K), and they were the largest single source of false-positive secret
# findings in a publication scan (high-entropy IDs inside the XML).
tests/reports/
